; The theory whose libraries the separate-through, separate-as-module,
; separate-aliased, separate-kinds, separate-results, and
; separate-dependent tests use: Outer, with functors with functors in
; their bodies, their applications, and a functor signature that declares
; a functor, AsModule, with functors defined as a module and as their
; parameter, Aliased, with an application and a functor with aliases in
; its body, Kinds, with a module type whose abstract type takes a
; parameter, ResultSigs, with a functor signature whose result leaves an
; abstract type, and Dependent, with a functor body member and a module
; type specification of a dependent type. It is a directory of its own
; because the extraction of a test claims every directory under it.

(rocq.theory
 (name ThroughLibs)
 (theories TypeScriptExtraction))
